				<guid>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/architektur-und-bauplastik-der-gegenwart/manifest.json</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This book from 1938 contains many buildings in the style of the &amp;ldquo;3rd Reich&amp;rdquo;, such as barracks, ministries, Ordensburgen and also autobahns. But it also includes some industrial buildings that can be assigned to the &amp;ldquo;Neues Bauen&amp;rdquo; movement, and a building by &#xA;        &#xA;          &#xA;        &lt;a data-wikidata-entity=&#34;Q77380&#34; href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fritz_H%C3%B6ger&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Fritz Höger&lt;/a&gt;, the Rüstringen town hall.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
